cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript once published. This repository is a manuscript-derived reference implementation, not the authors' original code."
title: "MARS-TB: manuscript-derived reference implementation"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Reference implementation, tests and reporting material for 'Multi-Scale Vision-Language and Anatomical Graph Reasoning for Tuberculosis Detection from Chest Radiographs' (under review). Includes no trained weights and does not reproduce the manuscript's reported results."
